+/*
+ * scx_cmask_ref: validated reference to a BPF-arena cmask.
+ *
+ * scx_cmask_ref_init() normalizes the pointer into the arena and snapshots
+ * @base/@nr_cids. The snapshot is what downstream code uses for sizing - the
